bbpager is like the name suggests a pager tool for Blackbox.

WARNING:
When you change the stacking order (by raising and lowering windows) before you start bbpager, it will show up wrong in the pager. 
So just start the pager first :-)

I would like to know what you think of it, and what functionality should be
implemented in the pager. Like should you be able to move or resize windows 
in the pager. You can mail me: jkennis@chello.nl .

The files Image.cc (.hh) are taken from the Blackbox,
only one class-name was changed.

The files LinkedListed.cc (.hh) are taken from Blackbox without any change.

Author: John Kennis <jkennis@chello.nl>

Thanks to:

Brad Hughes  <bhughes@tcac.net>
	For writing the Blackbox Windowmanager (and with this a great deal 
	of the code for this application).
